sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Usuario
    participant Ctrl as ChequeraController
    participant FPDF as FormulariosToPdfService
    participant CheqClient as ChequeraClient
    participant LAClient as LectivoAlternativaClient
    participant CheqServ as ChequeraService
    participant Mail as JavaMailSender
    participant MsgChk as ChequeraMessageCheckClient

    User->>Ctrl: GET /sendChequera/bulk/...
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>CheqServ: sendChequeraBulk(...)
    activate CheqServ

    CheqServ->>CheqClient: createChequeraContextBulk(...)
    activate CheqClient
    CheqClient-->>CheqServ: List~UMPreferenceMPDto~
    deactivate CheqClient

    CheqServ->>FPDF: generateChequeraPdf(..., preferences)
    activate FPDF
    FPDF->>LAClient: findAllByTipo(...) [batch]
    activate LAClient
    LAClient-->>FPDF: List~LectivoAlternativaDto~
    deactivate LAClient
    Note over FPDF: Filtra alternativas en memoria<br/>por cuota.getProductoId()
    FPDF-->>CheqServ: filenameChequera
    deactivate FPDF

    CheqServ->>Mail: send(mimeMessage)
    activate Mail
    Mail-->>CheqServ: void
    deactivate Mail

    CheqServ->>MsgChk: add(chequeraMessageCheck)
    activate MsgChk
    MsgChk-->>CheqServ: messageCheck
    deactivate MsgChk

    CheqServ-->>Ctrl: "Envio de Chequera Ok!!!"
    deactivate CheqServ
    Ctrl-->>User: HTTP 200 OK
    deactivate Ctrl
